> "I've compared the geometric face signets side by side with men who come in undecided between marquise and emerald. Almost every time, the marquise wins in yellow gold and the emerald wins in white. The face shape and metal temperature need to match — if they fight each other, the ring looks unfinished. I always check that alignment first."
>
> — Farzana Hasan, Diamond Critic

